LISA includes third-party Metal source and adapted host implementations.
Paths below describe the current source tree. Local changes to storage access,
dispatch, arithmetic specializations and source assembly do not remove the
upstream attributions or license requirements.

MLX
---
The MLX-derived kernels and helpers under crates/lisa-mlx/src/shaders/common/,
the flattened headers under crates/lisa-mlx/src/shaders/nax/, and MLX-derived
portions of shaders/qwen4/ originate in Apple's MLX:
https://github.com/ml-explore/mlx
Copyright (c) 2023-2025 Apple Inc. (individual sources retain their own years).
License: MIT, with the embedded math notices below retained separately.
Upstream license:
https://github.com/ml-explore/mlx/blob/main/LICENSE

Some sources are flattened header closures; others have local adaptations.
Original source identifiers and copyright comments are retained where present.
LISA's runtime and Rust dispatch are separate implementations.

