MTPLX
-----
crates/lisa-mlx/src/shaders/qwen4/qsa/{prefill,prefill_header,select,select_header}.metal
and crates/lisa-mlx/src/models/qwen4/qsa.rs are adapted from MTPLX:
https://github.com/youssofal/MTPLX
Copyright the MTPLX authors. License: Apache License, Version 2.0.
https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0
The source operations are mtplx/kernels/qsa_prefill_flash.py and
mtplx/kernels/qsa_indexer_select.py. The sparse-attention design and
block-selection tie-break (score - block_id * 1e-12) follow that project.
The local host dispatch, tensor layout and some kernel details are adapted.

Candle
------
The following sources derive from candle-metal-kernels 0.11.0:
https://github.com/huggingface/candle

- shaders/common/elementwise/elementwise_binary.metal: src/metal_src/binary.metal
- shaders/common/elementwise/cast.metal: src/metal_src/cast.metal
- shaders/common/elementwise/select.metal: src/metal_src/ternary.metal
- shaders/common/data/indexing.metal: src/metal_src/indexing.metal
- shaders/common/matmul/dense_gemm.metal: src/metal_src/mlx_gemm.metal
- shaders/common/matmul/dense_gemv.metal: src/metal_src/gemv.metal

All paths above are relative to crates/lisa-mlx/src/. These are vendored
kernel sources with local integration and adaptations, without a Candle runtime
dependency. Copyright (c) 2023-2025 Hugging Face and the contributing authors.
Candle is distributed under MIT or Apache-2.0; LISA's existing attribution uses
MIT. The GEMM/GEMV sources also retain their original Apple MLX MIT attribution
(Copyright (c) 2023-2024 Apple Inc.).

DS4
---
DS4-derived GLM kernels live under crates/lisa-mlx/src/shaders/glm53/ and in
common/attention/ds4_flash_attn.metal, common/matmul/glm53_*.metal and
common/elementwise/glm53_moe_grouped_swiglu_weight.metal. Associated Rust
bindings and GLM execution code adapt DS4's shape gates and scheduling to
LISA's runtime and original MLX affine storage.

Upstream: https://github.com/antirez/ds4
Reference revision: b4e3faf5262b21db94ec309cf321640ff1eed460
Source families include metal/dense.metal, metal/glm53_bf16.metal, metal/dsv4_misc.metal,
metal/moe.metal and metal/flash_attn.metal.
